<title>USA: Eaton Vance sets two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>Eaton Vance sets two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eaton Vance Corp said Tuesday its directors had recommended a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The company said shareholders of record May 15 will receive new stock certificates for the additional shares in a mailing on May 29.</p>
<p>Additionally, the Boston-based investment management firm said its directors have authorized repurchase of up to one million non-voting common shares on a post split basis.</p>
</text>
